    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O`Hanlon Property are delighted to present this spacious five-bedroom detached residence, set on approximately one acre of grounds. The property offers generous accommodation over two floors, including a bright living room with marble fireplace and mahogany surround, a spacious kitchen/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms and two bathrooms on the ground floor, with two further bedrooms and attic storage upstairs.\n\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, PVC double glazing and CCTV, while the surrounding grounds provide excellent outdoor space. An ideal family home offering generous accommodation and excellent potential.\n\nLocation\nCarrickmacross is a well recognised market town serving a wide rural hinterland and with an excellent range of services on offer. There are three secondary and three primary schools in the town and there is a wide variety of leisure facilities including two Golf Courses, Football, Soccer, Athletics and Cycling Clubs and Dun a Rí Forest Park is 10 minutes` drive.\n\nThe town is highly regarded as a retail mecca for the region with an excellent variety of shops including Supervalu, Aldi and Lidl and there is a weekly street market. Leading international companies Active8 and Pilgrim`s Pride are amongst the main employers in the town. There are up to 20 bus connections to/from Dublin each day and Dundalk Train Station is within 25 minutes` drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\nWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to the main living accommodation.\n\nLiving Room - 4.8m (15'9\") x 4.1m (13'5\")\nSpacious living room featuring a marble fireplace with mahogany surround and back boiler, complemented by a polished pine ceiling.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.4m (21'0\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\nGenerously proportioned kitchen and dining area with fitted units and stainless steel sink unit.\n\nUtility Room - 2.8m (9'2\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\nPractical utility room with fitted units, plumbing and a door providing access to the rear.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nWith fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.3m (14'1\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nWith fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.9m (12'10\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\nWith fitted wardrobes\n\nEn-suite\nEn-suite shower room fitted with a Mira shower, WC and WHB.\n\nMain Bathroom\nFamily bathroom with bath, WC and WHB.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 4 / Attic Storage - 4.1m (13'5\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nWell proportioned room offering flexible accommodation and attic storage.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nSpacious bedroom\n\nAttic Room - 5.5m (18'1\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nExcellent attic room ideally suitable for a home office, playroom or tv room.\n\nWC\nWC, WHB\n\nOutside\nSpacious garden to front and rear with lawns, shrubberies and trees.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
